  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '1. WHAT SKILL PROOF IS

    Skill Proof is a research prototype. It lets you practise and demonstrate selected practical tasks (electrical wiring and solar panel installation) in virtual reality and creates a performance record.

    

    2. NOT REAL-WORLD TRAINING OR CERTIFICATION

    Results show how you performed in the simulation only. They are not an official qualification, a trade test result or a licence to work. Do not attempt real electrical or solar work because you passed a simulation. Real electrical work can injure or kill. Always follow local safety rules and work under qualified supervision.

    

    3. YOUR ACCOUNT

    Give accurate details. Keep your password private. You are responsible for activity on your account. You must be 18 or older.

    

    4. USING THE HEADSET SAFELY

    Use the headset in a clear space. Stop if you feel dizzy, sick or uncomfortable. Take breaks.

    

    5. ACCEPTABLE USE

    Do not cheat, tamper with scores, edit or forge evidence PDFs, copy or reverse-engineer the app, or use another person''s account.

    

    6. YOUR DATA

    How we handle your data is explained in the Privacy Policy. By creating an account you confirm you have read it.

    

    7. OWNERSHIP

    The app and its code belong to Wakhile Dlamini. Third-party tools and assets belong to their owners and are used under their licences. You keep ownership of your own personal data.

    

    8. NO WARRANTY AND LIMIT OF LIABILITY

    The app is provided as is, as a prototype. To the extent the law allows, the developer is not liable for loss or harm from using it or relying on its results, including any employment decision based on the evidence PDF.

    

    9. CHANGES AND ENDING ACCESS

    These terms may change. The version date will change and you may be asked to accept again. Access may be ended if the terms are broken or the prototype is withdrawn.

    

    10. GOVERNING LAW

    Eswatini.

    

    11. CONTACT

    w.dlamini@alustudent.com'
