  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Skill Proof is a research prototype built by Wakhile Dlamini, a student at African Leadership University, supervised by Tunde Isiaq Gbadamosi.

    

    WHAT WE COLLECT

    Your name, email address and password when you create an account. Your simulation results: activities completed, errors, safety violations, time used, and your safety, competency and procedural scores.

    

    WHY

    To show your results on your profile and to create your evidence PDF. We use nothing else for any other purpose.

    

    WHERE IT IS KEPT

    Your account is handled by Firebase Authentication. Passwords are stored in hashed form, so the developer cannot read them. Your results are stored in Cloud Firestore. Your evidence PDF is saved on the headset and emailed to you through a Google Apps Script. These services run on Google servers, which may be outside your country.

    

    WHO CAN SEE IT

    You can. The researcher can see account and result data to run the study. Study reports use participant IDs, not names. Your data is not sold and is not shared with employers.

    

    WHAT YOUR EVIDENCE MEANS

    The PDF shows how you performed in a simulation. It is not an official qualification and does not replace a trade test.

    

    HOW LONG WE KEEP IT

    2028-01-01

    

    YOUR RIGHTS

    You can stop using the app at any time. You can ask to see, correct or delete your data, or withdraw your consent, at any time by emailing w.dlamini@alustudent.com. We will reply within [30 days].

    

    RECORDING

    The in-app record button records only when you press it. The video is saved on the headset.

    

    CHILDREN

    Skill Proof is for people aged 18 and over.

    

    CHANGES

    If this policy changes, the version date above changes and you will be asked to accept it again.

    

    CONTACT

    Wakhile Dlamini, African Leadership University

    w.dlamini@alustudent.com'
